WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:41.620
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:48.460
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.800
<i>continue their adventure
to stop Millenniumon's return</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.010
<i>as they gather their friends.</i>

00:01:56.920 --> 00:02:01.050
<i>Yamato and Gabumon were also
on their way to rejoin everyone.</i>

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.260
<i>However!</i>

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:06.930
<i>They happened to pass by some mountains</i>

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:12.730
<i>where manipulated Digimon
were eerily lurking.</i>

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:16.690
<i>Great danger was approaching Gabumon.</i>

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.590
THE BLAZING BLUE FRIENDSHIP

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.170
Ow, ow!

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.010
Gomamon, you ok...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.550
Achoo!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:25.060
Brr! Clothes! Where's my clothes?!

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.520
My bag!

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:27.600
This?

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.600
Oh, thanks...

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.900
-Yamato!
-Yamato-kun!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.280
Joe, your clothes first.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.190
Oh.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.780
We were caught by these
roughneck Digimon at the hot springs.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:46.700
We were struggling
to find a way out of it somehow.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:53.630
Then, we found a rock that was plugging
a hole at the bottom of the hot springs.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:56.510
When we moved that over,

00:03:56.510 --> 00:04:01.300
we got swallowed into the hole
along with the water and...

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.760
Thanks for coming.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:04.470
Huh?

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:08.970
MEPHISMON

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:11.350
<i>Gabumon was captured?!</i>

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.560
<i>By some Digimon called Mephismon.</i>

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.480
ELECMON

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.700
Mephismon sucks the energy
of Digimon with an evil spell

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.130
and sends it to a black crystal.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:08.450
A black crystal? Isn't that...

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:12.080
One of the shards
of that Millenniumon guy?!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:19.340
The part of an ancient deadly Digimon's
body that came up in Taichi's story...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.540
Probably.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.630
By the way, that almost looks
like a ritual to offer up a sacrifice.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:29.470
Though I don't see the point
in that practice...

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:36.110
I can't just ignore this!

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.060
I...

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.940
have to save them!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:45.530
We decided to act and went in.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.160
<i>But we got separated.</i>

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.290
Garurumon!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.210
Yamato, you take those Digimon!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:04.130
Garurumon!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:10.970
Joe.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.350
Gomamon.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.180
I can't reach the very top alone.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.310
That's why...

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.770
lend me a hand!

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.270
Please.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.780
-Yeah!
-Of course!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:34.580
I... I never thought
you'd say something like that to me!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.460
We'll do it! Just leave it to us!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:38.290
Yeah!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.800
So I'm next.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.520
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.070
SALAMANDAMON

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:34.350
When we all got scattered
just after reaching this continent,

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.850
I worried what'll happen to us.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.810
But after everything, we only have
Yamato and Joe Senpai left now.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.610
I wonder if Yamato and Gabumon are okay.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.490
They should be fine!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:54.370
Since they seem like they've been doing
this together before I even met Agumon.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.210
That's true. I wonder since when.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.080
Do you know?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.120
Uh-uh.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.880
Me and Yamato
have been living apart for a long time.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.050
What?

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:09.800
Our daddy and mommy got into a fight.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:15.010
They were both busy with work,
so they weren't really home much.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.140
And so...

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.890
I went with Mommy
and Yamato went with Daddy.

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:25.690
But Yamato always contacted me
and came to see me a lot.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.360
I see...

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.400
Everybody, let's eat this together!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.900
Oh, thanks!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.580
That's true...

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.410
Hm?

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.160
Yamato and Gabumon...

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.920
<i>I wonder how they met.</i>

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.730
<i>Yamato!</i>

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.070
<i>It happened so suddenly.</i>

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.570
<i>A world I've never seen before.</i>

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.370
<i>And a strange creature
that called my name.</i>

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.120
What's all this Digimon
and Network crisis suddenly?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:29.590
I don't have the time to be listening
or getting involved with you.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.720
Find someone else.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.090
Yamato...

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.760
Where's the exit?

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.180
Don't follow me!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.100
No, I'm just protecting you
on my own, Yamato!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.230
That's okay, right?

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:56.150
<i>Gabumon suddenly appeared before me.</i>

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.660
I told you not to follow me.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.660
I have business this way too.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.220
<i>And then...</i>

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:34.150
<i>Gabumon really went and protected me.</i>

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.740
Hey, you!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.570
Yamato... run!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.540
Yamato!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.050
Jeez, what's with you?

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:41.510
Yamato, you protected me!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.350
You could've just left me there.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.560
I...

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.520
just protected you on my own too.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.400
You, what's your name?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.040
I'm coming...

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.830
Gabumon!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.200
What is this?!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:47.280
Ahh! There's a voice repeating
over and over inside my head!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.760
These guys must be
receiving orders from this spell.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.810
Shoot... I'm losing control.

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:11.560
D-Don't listen to it!

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:16.350
It's no use!
I can hear it even if I plug my ears!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.480
TEXTBOOK

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.660
I'm on my own now.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.510
Focus!

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.730
J-Joe?

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:02.990
The bells of Gion Shoja rings
with the impermanence of all.

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:08.780
The color of the sal flowers shows
that even the fortunate must fall.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.030
The capital relocated to Heijo-kyo in 710.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:15.290
The capital relocated to Heian-kyo in 794.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.460
Kamakura shogunate established in 1185.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.290
The Onin War began in 1467.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:25.260
Tokugawa Ieyasu came to power in 1603.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:29.260
Kamakura shogunate established in 1185.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.890
Three point one four
one five nine two six five...

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:39.360
Three point one four
one five nine two six five three five

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:44.320
eight nine seven nine
three two three eight four six

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:48.990
two six four three
three eight three two seven nine

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:53.500
five zero two eight
eight four one nine seven one...

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.870
Whoa!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.130
Hydrogen, helium,
lithium, beryllium, boron...

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:03.670
Sodium, magnesium,
aluminum, silicon, phosphorus!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:05.750
Huh?

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.260
My headache went away!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.220
Wait...

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.390
What?!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.140
...Gion Shoja rings...

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.390
What is this?

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:29.030
The capital relocated to Heian-kyo in 794.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:32.780
Yamato-kun, keep going!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.770
Yamato...

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:07.820
Gabumon...

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.920
CHIBICKMON

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.180
What's going on?!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.400
Gabumon!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.740
Yamato... don't!

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.420
I'm coming...

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:11.720
I told you not to come!

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:14.260
If you come now, you'll also be...

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.930
Just shut up and wait right there.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.020
You stubborn fool!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.770
Your stubbornness rubbed off on me.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:40.030
I changed after I met you.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.500
I gained something important!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.800
Gabumon, you were...

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:03.020
You were my very first...

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:07.810
friend!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.290
You good to go, Gabumon?

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:27.540
Yeah, since I'm with you, Yamato.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.930
Gabumon Evolution!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.570
Garurumon!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.820
Fox Fire!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.910
Cut through that cloud!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:16.920
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:33.110
Weregarurumon!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.400
Let's finish this!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.230
Yeah!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.650
Kaiser Nail!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:04.780
Wow, you climbed this?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.540
Not by myself.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.250
Joe and Gomamon helped.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:10.290
And...

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.290
you too.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:15.710
Me?

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:18.090
Yamato!

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:33.040
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.420
<i>Eldoradimon.</i>

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:39.630
<i>A gigantic Digimon that carries
a whole castle on the shell.</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.960
LEVEL: MEGA

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:40.500
TYPE: MUTANT

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.960
<i>The castle gates are
at the top of Eldoradimon's head!</i>

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:42.960
SPECIAL MOVE: GOLDEN ROAD
METEOR EARTHQUAKE / GIANT NIPPER

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:45.430
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:47.430
<i>"What does Eldoradimon eat?"</i>

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:51.100
<i>or "Who fixes the castle
if the shell flips over and breaks?"</i>

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>I have endless questions.
I wonder if I can ask for an interview?</i>

00:22:57.600 --> 00:22:59.940
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:05.780
<i>Big trouble occurs over french fries
in a peaceful oasis.</i>

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:08.120
<i>Can Joe save his friend?!</i>

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:11.780
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Jyagamon, Potato Hell"</i>

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.580
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
